{"id": "d885ce6e-78ba-49ae-ad28-6074110a5e45", "slug": "ai-website-generator", "title": "AI Website Generator", "description": "Website Generator Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"AI Website Generator\"\ndescription: \"Website Generator Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#8AB4F8\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#FF5500\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#141E3C\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AI Website Generator\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 30; favorites: 13; remixes: 0.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, bento, billing.\n## Overview\nWebsite Generator Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nFrom Any Website to Your Own — Instantly Remix, convert, and build full designs with AI in seconds. Try the Workflow Sys.Core Solutions Pricing API AI-Powered Plan Review [1] Detects structural elements [2] Highlights i…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: From Any Website to Your Own — Instantly; AI-Powered Plan Review; Autonomous Harvesting; AI powered prosthetics; Sell Your Software To Anyone.; Modern Healthcare..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8AB4F8, secondary #050505, accent #FF5500, background #050505, surface #141E3C, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-50 selection:bg-white/20\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AI Website Generator</title>\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            background-color: #050505;\n        }\n\n        .perspective-container {\n            perspective: 1800px;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n\n        .stack-card {\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            will-change: transform, opacity, filter;\n            box-shadow: 0 40px 100px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        /* Ambient background glow */\n        .ambient-glow {\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(20, 30, 60, 0.4) 0%, rgba(5, 5, 5, 1) 70%);\n        }\n\n        .noise-overlay {\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            opacity: 0.03;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n        }\n\n        /* Scanline effect */\n        @keyframes scan {\n            0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }\n            100% { transform: translateY(200%); }\n        }\n        .scanner-line {\n            animation: scan 2s linear infinite;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Background Elements -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 ambient-glow z-0\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 noise-overlay z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Vignette -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 150px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center z-20\">\n\n        <!-- Text Overlay layer (Centered, fixed relative to screen) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-50 px-6 pt-32 sm:pt-0 pb-[30vh]\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl gap-6\">\n                <!-- Masked Reveal Headline -->\n                <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1]\">\n                    From Any Website to Your Own — Instantly\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-lg font-light\">\n                    Remix, convert, and build full designs with AI in seconds.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"pt-4 pointer-events-auto\">\n                    <button class=\"group relative inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white px-8 font-medium text-neutral-950 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] focus:outline-none\">\n                        <span class=\"mr-2 text-sm\">Try the Workflow</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3D Stack Container -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 perspective-container w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center z-30 pointer-events-none mt-20 sm:mt-40\">\n            <!-- Cards will be injected/manipulated by JS here -->\n            <div id=\"card-stack\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1000px] h-[600px] pointer-events-auto\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Technical / Data (Permitify style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <!-- Top Bar -->\n                    <div class=\"h-10 border-b border-neutral-800 bg-black/50 flex items-center justify-between px-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 font-mono\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span>Sys.Core</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                            <span>Solutions</span>\n                            <span>Pricing</span>\n                            <span>API</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Body -->\n                    <div class=\"flex h-full w-full bg-[#E53935] text-white\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1/2 p-10 flex flex-col justify-center border-r border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 20px 20px;\"></div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-6xl mb-6 opacity-80\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-4 uppercase\">AI-Powered<br>Plan Review</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-mono leading-relaxed\">\n                                [1] Detects structural elements<br>\n                                [2] Highlights inconsistencies<br>\n                                [3] Helps professionals quickly assess\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1/2 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm relative\">\n                            <!-- Scanner effect -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent h-[20px] scanner-line mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-48 h-48 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:scanner-linear\" class=\"text-6xl text-white/50\" stroke-width=\"1\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Nature / Industrial (Red Barn style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Abstract Hills\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 sepia-[.3] hue-rotate-[-30deg] contrast-125\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-black/60\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-xs text-white/80\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium tracking-tight text-sm\">TerraCorp</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n                                <span>Home</span>\n                                <span>Robotics</span>\n                                <span>Investors</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-end p-10 pb-16\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#F25C54] p-6 inline-block transform -skew-x-3\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white transform skew-x-3\">Autonomous<br>Harvesting</h2>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Modern Tech / Blue (Robotic hand style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/e534354d-c5f2-4399-a1d9-2f50338e8c47_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Blue Wave\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8AB4F8]/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-[2px]\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center p-5 text-xs text-white border-b border-white/10\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                                <span class=\"opacity-50\">01</span>\n                                <span class=\"opacity-50\">02</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium tracking-wide\">PROCEPTION</span>\n                            <button class=\"border border-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors text-[10px]\">Get in touch</button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-10 mt-10 max-w-lg\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#8AB4F8] mb-4 block\">/ Powered by top tech /</span>\n                            <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6\">AI powered<br>prosthetics</h2>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 4: Bold Orange (Archon style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-8 text-xs text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-200\">\n                        <span class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">archon</span>\n                        <div class=\"hidden sm:flex gap-6 font-medium\">\n                            <span>How it works</span>\n                            <span>Blog</span>\n                            <span>Docs</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"bg-black text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium\">Book a demo</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#FF5500] h-full p-10 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-black\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-black font-medium tracking-tight text-xl\">Platform</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black leading-none max-w-xl\">Sell Your<br>Software To<br>Anyone.</h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 5: Minimal White (K-Store style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-neutral-200 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center p-8 text-xs text-neutral-500\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smile-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n                            <span class=\"hover:text-black cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Clinic</span>\n                            <span class=\"hover:text-black cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Store</span>\n                            <span class=\"hover:text-black cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Team</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#2962FF] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md font-medium flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors\">\n                            Make an appointment <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-10 relative\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1/3 aspect-square bg-neutral-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply opacity-50\"></div>\n                        <h2 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black text-center z-10 leading-[1.1]\">Modern<br>Healthcare.</h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 6: Dark Cinematic (Hyve Systems style) -->\n                <div class=\"stack-card absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-full max-w-[800px] aspect-[16/9] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-xl bg-[#0A0D14] border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                         <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/fa51902b-c2a4-4c33-a96e-a8f1ef67edc6_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Neon Wave\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 mix-blend-lighten\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center p-6 text-xs text-neutral-400 border-b border-white/5 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                            <span class=\"text-white font-medium tracking-widest text-sm\">HYVE.SYSTEMS</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n                                <span>Services</span>\n                                <span>Examples</span>\n                                <span>Benefits</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#00FF9D] flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\">Book a consultation <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\"></iconify-icon></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center p-10\">\n                            <div class=\"max-w-md\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-4\">Scaling compute<br>to the physical limit.</h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">Advanced infrastructural design for next-generation intelligence. We build the foundations of tomorrow's networks.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flash-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-white opacity-0 mix-blend-overlay transition-opacity duration-200\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // --- GSAP Text Reveal Animation ---\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const title = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n            if (title) {\n                // Simple manual word split for standalone functionality\n                const text = title.innerText;\n                title.innerHTML = '';\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    if (word === '—') {\n                        const span = document.createElement('span');\n                        span.className = 'inline-block mx-2 text-neutral-600';\n                        span.innerText = word;\n                        title.appendChild(span);\n                        return;\n                    }\n\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.className = 'inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2 mr-[0.2em] -mb-2 align-bottom';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.className = 'word-inner inline-block will-change-transform';\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    title.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n\n                // Animate\n                gsap.fromTo(title.querySelectorAll('.word-inner'),\n                    { y: '120%', rotationZ: 2 },\n                    {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        rotationZ: 0,\n                        duration: 1,\n                        stagger: 0.04,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        delay: 0.2\n                    }\n                );\n\n                gsap.fromTo(title.nextElementSibling,\n                    { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n                    { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, delay: 0.8, ease: \"power3.out\" }\n                );\n            }\n\n            // --- 3D Stack Conveyor Animation ---\n            const cards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.stack-card'));\n            const totalCards = cards.length;\n            let globalProgress = 0;\n            const SPEED = 0.0006; // Control speed of loop\n            let isHovered = false;\n            let animationFrameId;\n\n            // Initialize stack positions\n            function renderStack() {\n                if (!isHovered) {\n                    globalProgress += SPEED;\n                }\n\n                cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                    // Distribute cards equally along the 0-1 progress loop\n                    let p = (globalProgress + (index / totalCards)) % 1;\n\n                    // Math logic for position:\n                    // p = 0 is entering from bottom (large, front)\n                    // p = 0.5 is middle focus\n                    // p = 1 is exiting top (small, back, blurred)\n\n                    // Curve the Y movement so they bunch slightly at the top\n                    // Uses an eased curve to make center movement slower\n                    let easeP = p < 0.5 ? 2 * p * p : -1 + (4 - 2 * p) * p;\n\n                    // Vertical spread\n                    let y = 500 - (p * 1100);\n\n                    // Scale perspective\n                    let scale = 1 - (p * 0.4);\n\n                    // Z-index calculation (bottom is highest)\n                    let zIndex = Math.round((1 - p) * 100);\n\n                    // Slight tilt backward as it goes up\n                    let rotateX = p * 15;\n\n                    // Opacity fade in/out at extremes\n                    let opacity = 1;\n                    if (p < 0.1) opacity = p / 0.1; // Fade in bottom\n                    if (p > 0.85) opacity = (1 - p) / 0.15; // Fade out top\n\n                    // Apply styles\n                    card.style.transform = `translate(-50%, -50%) translateY(${y}px) scale(${scale}) rotateX(${rotateX}deg)`;\n                    card.style.zIndex = zIndex;\n                    card.style.opacity = opacity;\n\n                    // Add depth blur\n                    let blurAmt = p > 0.6 ? (p - 0.6) * 15 : 0;\n                    card.style.filter = `blur(${blurAmt}px) brightness(${isHovered ? (card.dataset.hovered === \"true\" ? 1.1 : 0.6) : 1})`;\n\n                    // Conversion Flash Effect Logic\n                    const flash = card.querySelector('.flash-overlay');\n                    if (flash) {\n                        // Trigger flash when passing through focus zone (~0.4)\n                        if (p > 0.38 && p < 0.42 && !card.dataset.flashed) {\n                            flash.style.opacity = '1';\n                            setTimeout(() => { flash.style.opacity = '0'; }, 150);\n                            card.dataset.flashed = \"true\";\n                        } else if (p > 0.6 || p < 0.2) {\n                            card.dataset.flashed = \"\"; // Reset flag\n                        }\n                    }\n                });\n\n                animationFrameId = requestAnimationFrame(renderStack);\n            }\n\n            // Hover Interactions\n            cards.forEach(card => {\n                card.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n                    isHovered = true;\n                    card.dataset.hovered = \"true\";\n                    card.style.transition = \"transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275)\";\n\n                    // Slight pop on hover while paused\n                    let currentTransform = card.style.transform;\n                    card.style.transform = currentTransform + ' scale(1.02)';\n                });\n\n                card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    isHovered = false;\n                    card.dataset.hovered = \"false\";\n                    card.style.transition = \"none\"; // Remove transition to resume smooth JS loop\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Start loop\n            renderStack();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ai-website-generator.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/ai-website-generator.jpg", "source_name": "ai-website-generator-DESIGN.md", "views": 310, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:54:23.010122+00:00"}